## Interface: 120100
## Title: MaxDps Bridge Exp
## Notes: Experimental in-game-config fork of MaxDpsBridge. Owns its toggles (overlay-wins, SlotAllowed gate; Main is the master switch that suspends every slot without rewriting the others), adds a compact RICE-style insecure overlay (no profile footer), a 6-tab Settings canvas and /mdbx. Mutually exclusive with the stable MaxDpsBridge: if the stable bridge is loaded this addon stays inert. No secure templates, no protected Lua. Same additive protocol v5 wire as the stable bridge plus the Ext4 hotbar-map block (51-cell strip; version nibble stays 5).
## Author: AnBPublic
## Version: 4.2.0-exp
## X-Codename: Nightblade
## OptionalDeps: MaxDps, GW2_UI
